   ]
  },
  "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31528-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31528-05.html",
   "quest": 22,
   "text": "Ghost of Priest: You must mean Lidia von Hellmann, she was the only survivor of the tragedy here.",
   "header": "Ghost of Priest",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"What tragedy?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest 31528-06.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest",
     "event": "31528-06.html",
     "quest": 22,
     "to": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31528-06.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31528-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31528-06.html",
   "quest": 22,
   "text": "Ghost of Priest: The tragedy of the Hellmann forest was the massacre of the royal family. The King's army slaughtered them and all of their supporters. That's how this forest got it's name.",
   "header": "Ghost of Priest",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Why were they killed?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest 31528-07.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest",
     "event": "31528-07.html",
     "quest": 22,
     "to": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31528-07.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31528-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31528-07.html",
   "quest": 22,
   "text": "Ghost of Priest: The Hellmann family had revolted against the kingdom, hoping that the King would fight. However, the King had lost his will to fight since losing his wife and son at the battle against Amadeo, King of Aden. The result was a disaster and not what Alfred Von Hellmann had wanted.",
   "header": "Ghost of Priest",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "I need to ask him if there was somebody behind the scenes.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest 31528-08.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest",
     "event": "31528-08.html",
     "quest": 22,
     "to": "Q00022_TragedyInVonHellmannForest/31528-08.html",
     "effect": "cond:8"
    }
   ]
  },
